## Local-only surface

- No claude.ai-product surface: account skill/plugin sync, claude.ai connectors and Remote
  Control are off in settings, the cron scheduler by env; tool and skill denies live in agents.yaml.
  `/code-review ultra` and `claude --cloud` have no disable knob, both user-invoked only.
